Cellmate is a derivative of the Omarchy shell "power" panel plugin
(omarchy.power), originally published by the Omarchy project under the MIT
License: https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy

The upstream source of the base panel lives at:
  omarchy/shell/plugins/panels/power/  (Package: omarchy)

Modifications: multi-battery aggregation, wattage history chart with
persistence, per-process energy attribution, and a compacted UI.
